{
  "$schema": "https://schemas.cerberauth.com/identity-provider/draft/2024-09/provider.schema.json",
  "name": "Gravitee Access Management",
  "abstract": "Open-source identity and access management server from Gravitee, written in Java, with an enterprise edition and a hosted offering. Acts as an OAuth 2.0 and OpenID Connect provider, a SAML 2.0 identity provider and service provider, and exposes UMA 2.0 and SCIM 2.0 services. Authenticates against LDAP and Active Directory, databases, social, OIDC and SAML providers, supports MFA, passwordless login and custom authentication flows built from policies. The community edition is limited to a single organization and environment.",
